  "/api/ask": {
   "post": {
    "description": "流式回答。支持用户中断：前端 abort 后，这里会停止向上游模型要 token。\n\n刻意写成 async def（而不是同步 def）：只有在协程里才能 await 出让控制权，\n从而定期检查 `request.is_disconnected()`。写成同步函数时 FastAPI 会丢进线程池，\n客户端断开后那个线程仍会把生成跑到底——白烧本地 GPU，或继续消耗用户的\nClaude/GLM 付费额度。这不是优化，是避免\"用户点了停止还在扣他的钱\"。",
    "operationId": "ask_api_ask_post",
    "requestBody": {
     "content": {
      "application/json": {
       "schema": {
        "$ref": "#/components/schemas/AskRequest"
       }
      }
     },
     "required": true
    },
    "responses": {
     "200": {
      "content": {
       "application/json": {
        "schema": {
         "type": "object"
        }
       }
      },
      "description": "Successful Response"
     },
     "422": {
      "content": {
       "application/json": {
        "schema": {
         "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
        }
       }
      },
      "description": "Validation Error"
     }
    },
    "summary": "Ask"
   }
  },
